Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 08:18:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] deps: golang.org/x/crypto v0.41.0 -> v0.43.0
 (GO-2025-4116)

The highest x/crypto release whose go directive keeps this module's
documented Go 1.24 floor. It fixes GO-2025-4116 (ssh/agent denial of
service), reachable through computers.NewSSHBackend. Seven further
reachable x/crypto/ssh advisories need v0.52.0 (go 1.25) or v0.56.0
(go 1.26); that upgrade is supplied as an opt-in patch file in the audit
report because it raises the toolchain floor, which is a project
decision rather than a dependency fix.

Audit patch P10a. Rollback: git revert this commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
